OL,3,GNEWSAFree Sunday parking could end by
OL,4,ADecember
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree Sunday parking in pay-and-display
OL,7,Fcar parks could end as soon as December
OL,8,Ffor drivers in Somerset.
OL,10,FA move to bring in parking charges
OL,11,Fseven days a week has been in the works
OL,12,Ffor months, but has proven
OL,13,Fcontroversial and was voted down by
OL,14,Fcouncillors in December 2025.
OL,16,FNow Somerset Council has confirmed the
OL,17,Fchanges will be voted on by its
OL,18,Fexecutive committee on 23 September,
OL,19,Fahead of changes possibly being
OL,20,Fintroduced in December.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
