OL,3,GNEWSAFree Sunday parking could end by
OL,4,ADecember
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Richard Wilkins, the
OL,7,Fcouncil's lead for highways and
OL,8,Ftransport, said the move was about
OL,9,F"fairness and consistency" across the
OL,10,Fcounty.
